{"user": "how do i play", "user_ts": "2026-08-20T02:19:43.303839+00:00", "assistant": "You play **Black** by choosing one of the pale-dot legal squares: **g2, b6, a7, b7, b8, or c8**.\n\nRules reminder:\n- Place a black disc so it \u201csandwiches\u201d white discs in a straight line.\n- Any sandwiched white discs flip to black.\n- If a player has **no legal move**, they **pass**.\n- When the board fills, **more discs wins**.\n\nFor this endgame, don\u2019t just pick the move that flips most now. Ask:\n1. Does my move let White take a **corner** next?\n2. Does it leave White with **few legal moves**?\n3. After White\u2019s reply, who gets the last big flips?\n\nIf you want, I can help you compare two candidate moves you\u2019re considering.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-20T02:19:51.836030+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-20T02:19:54.296813+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Hint": 2}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Hint": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint", "Prompt"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"]}}
